  </section>

  <!-- INTRO -->

  <section class="intro">
    <h2>Websites Made Simple.</h2>
    <p>
      Building a professional website shouldn't be complicated
      or unnecessarily expensive. WebRite focuses on transparent
      pricing, practical functionality, and websites that help
      businesses attract customers and generate leads.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING -->

  <h2 class="section-title">Website Pricing</h2>

  <p class="section-note">
    Choose a package that fits your business today.
    Additional features and automation can be added as you grow.
  </p>

  <div class="pricing">

    <div class="price-card">
      <h3>Solo</h3>
      <div class="amount">$199&ndash;$299</div>
      <div class="monthly">Optional care: $0&ndash;$35/month</div>
